{"id":"8d95e8e36c","t":"Be Blues","c":"cv","n":51,"l":87,"s":["aq"],"k":{"aq":"be-blues"},"u":1795035948323,"desc":"إن نشأت بلعب كرة القدم في اليابان، فسترغب بتمثيل المنتخب الوطني. وكحال الجميع، إيتشيجو ريو فتى يحلم بأن يصبح لاعبًا للمنتخب الوطني. وبصحبة صديقَا الطفولة التؤام يوكي، ويوتو، سيسعى أولاً لتحقيق بطولة اليابان تحت سن 12.الشّغف لرؤية مواجهة فردية! الضغط أمام المرمى! وبهجة إحراز هجمة نموذجية!هنا تجد كل ما يميز كرة القدم.","type":"مانجا يابانية","status":"مستمرة","genres":["رياضة","شونين"],"src":{"aq":"be-blues"},"chapters":{"6":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/6/"},"37":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/37/"},"38":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/38/"},"39":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/39/"},"40":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/40/"},"41":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/41/"},"42":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/42/"},"43":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/43/"},"44":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/44/"},"45":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/45/"},"46":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/46/"},"47":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/47/"},"48":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/48/"},"49":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/49/"},"50":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/50/"},"51":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/51/"},"52":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/52/"},"53":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/53/"},"54":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/54/"},"55":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/55/"},"56":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/56/"},"57":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/57/"},"58":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/58/"},"59":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/59/"},"60":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/60/"},"61":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/61/"},"62":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/62/"},"63":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/63/"},"64":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/64/"},"66":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/66/"},"67":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/67/"},"68":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/68/"},"69":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/69/"},"70":{"aq":"be-blues|/manga/be-blues/70/"},"